<div class='doc-title'>POLITICALLY EXPOSED PERSON (PEP) DECLARATION FORM</div>

<p style='font-size: 9.5pt; color: #666057; font-style: italic;'>
The information collected in this form is mandatory to comply with Federal Decree-Law No. (20) of 2018 on Anti-Money Laundering, Combating the Financing of Terrorism and Financing of Illegal Organisations, Cabinet Decision No. 109 of 2023, and FATF Recommendations.
</p>

<div class='box'>
  <strong>Definition of Politically Exposed Person (PEP):</strong><br>
  A Politically Exposed Person (PEP) is an individual who is or who has been entrusted with prominent public functions domestically or by a foreign government/international body. Prominent public functions include:
  <ol style='margin: 6px 0 6px 20px;'>
    <li>Head of State or Head of Government</li>
    <li>Senior politician or senior government official</li>
    <li>Senior judicial or military official</li>
    <li>Member of a ruling royal family</li>
    <li>Senior executive of a state-owned corporation or government-linked entity</li>
    <li>Important political party official</li>
  </ol>
  <em>The definition also encompasses immediate family members (spouse, children, parents, siblings) and close business associates or personal advisers of individuals stated above.</em>
</div>

<div style='margin-bottom: 20px;'>
  <p><strong>1. Are you or any beneficial owner/director a Politically Exposed Person (PEP)?</strong><br>
  [&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;] <strong>YES</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;] <strong>NO</strong></p>

  <p><strong>2. Are you or the corporate entity related to, or in close partnership with, a PEP?</strong><br>
  [&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;] <strong>YES</strong> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;] <strong>NO</strong></p>
</div>

